<title>CANADA: DBRS confirms North West Co senior debt.</title>
<headline>DBRS confirms North West Co senior debt.</headline>
<dateline>TORONTO 1997-04-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dominion Bond Rating Service Ltd said on Tuesday that it had confirmed its BBB (low) senior debt rating with a stable trend for the North West Company Inc.</p>
<p>North West improved its earnings in fiscal 1997 and reorganised itself into an &quot;income trust,&quot; enhancing shareholder value without harming the company's credit qualtiy, DBRS said.</p>
<p>((Paul Simao, Reuters Toronto Bureau (416) 941-8104))</p>
